{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "03573294-fbb2-8a91-a725-ef437e90865d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:36:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anthony Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth, yeah, hi. So I'm Anthony Conti, and I'm on speakerphone, I'm in the driveway, so if I sound echoey that's why. Um, so my sister-in-law's kid, well, she's been staying with us a little, and he's ten, and he's been shooting hoops against the garage door every night since about October, so I figured, you know, let's get him on an actual team."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I love that. Good for him. So you're looking at the winter youth basketball?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, that. The winter youth basketball sign-up. Is that still open? I didn't want to wait till it was too late, because last year I waited on something else and it was full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's still open right now. You can register through the recreation page on the city website, or you can come by the office and fill out a paper form. Either one works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. And do you know the start date? Like when do the games or the practices start? [line breaks up] sorry, I think I'm losing you a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I can hear you. The season kicks off in early January, and the coach sends out the first practice details once the teams are set. I'd check the program page for the exact first date, because it can shift with the gym schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early January, okay. That's good. Oh, and one more thing, this is the weird part. I got a text on my phone the other day, and it's in a language I don't speak at all. I think maybe Portuguese? I can't tell. It mentions basketball, I think, because I can pick out the word. Is that from you guys?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, it could be from us. We send reminders out through a texting system, and some families get them in other languages. Do you know if he's been signed up for anything before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think his mom might have put the number down, yeah, which is my number, so that would explain it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would do it. Give me the child's name and I'll look him up and see what's on file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thank you so much, Beth. His name is Mateus. M-A-T-E-U-S. And my number is 401-555-0197 if you need to call me back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Let me pull that up for you."
    }
  ],
